very, um, irritating
the HTML players are all attempting to force a decision ASAP -- as is FF
I am tempted to use other words and phrases, but I shall refrain from doing so.
i admire your restraint (grin)
i'll push RichS on the issue at the noon PF call
i'm wary of too much horse-trading being conducted behind closed doors
will calmly ask for a reference to the meeting call.
ok, you're the &quot;good cop&quot; and i'm the &quot;bad cop&quot; -- that's how it usually shakes out in these situations!
http://www.w3.org/2007/10/17-aria-minutes.html
